30,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's worse than I thought. Some people leave rubbish and empty tanks, and our weekly routines are the first things to fail.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,May,,"Tracking every run is a huge time sink, and those heavy-use weeks are absolute nightmares to coordinate.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are quite high, and the fuel spending is incredibly lopsided. Some are paying far more than others.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Other groups say asking for favors is what kills the mood. Also, checking each other's math just makes everyone feel accused.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Weekends are way busier than weekdays, and all these short trips are actually wearing out the brakes and battery faster.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, if fuel is lopsided, that explains why some of us are frustrated.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,May,,"@Takumi, so the ""checking"" part is what makes us fight? That's exactly what I want to avoid.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. We have a financial imbalance and a social one.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly. If we make it too clinical with figures, we'll just end up hating each other more.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, if the weekly trips are collapsing, we need a way to lock those in.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, yes, but not if the car is left dirty or empty by the person before me.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,May,,"@Servas, if the costs are that high, we can't just keep guessing who pays what.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Servas,,We need a system that is fair but doesn't require us to act like accountants.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"I agree. We need to stop the ""favor"" cycle.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,But we can't ignore that some of us use it way more on weekends.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
