55,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A would protect my weekly trips, but I worry about the car's state. Option C seems more flexible.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,May,,Option C sounds like a recording nightmare. Option A is the simplest for my schedule.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option B puts the burden on one person, which might be unfair. Option C is the most precise for costs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option A avoids the ""asking for favors"" problem entirely. I really dislike the idea of Option C's tracking.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option C is the only one that honestly reflects the distance and usage we found in the diary.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, if we do Option A, do we still have to coordinate the cleaning?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, probably, but at least we don't have to argue about who gets it on Tuesday.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, precision is good, but Takumi is right—too much tracking leads to resentment.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly! Option A is clean. You have your day, you use it, no questions asked.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Kenji,,But Option A means someone might pay for a day they don't even use!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm leaning toward A. It stops the collapse of my weekly routine.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,May,,I'm voting A. I can't handle any more coordination hours.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Servas,,I will vote for A as well. It's a fair compromise that avoids constant auditing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Takumi,,A is the only way to save our friendship. I'm in.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"I still prefer C for the money, but if everyone hates the tracking, I'll go with A.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
